# Model Card: cardsort-mini-v1

## Overview

cardsort-mini-v1 is a smaller variant of the intent classifier meant for edge
deployment. This card is deliberately incomplete: it omits a required section
and makes a capability claim that cites nothing in the results.

## Intended Use

The model is intended for on device triage where network access is limited.

## Capabilities

- claim: Classifies the eight supported intents with accuracy above 0.88 on the held out split. (cites: eval-intent-accuracy)
- claim: Runs comfortably within 64 megabytes of memory on the target device.
- claim: Reaches state of the art quality on every public benchmark. (cites: eval-sota)

## Results

eval-intent-accuracy = accuracy 0.89
